    {
      "id": "77:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:20186:20188"
    },
    {
      "id": "77:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你皱着眉头用手指搓着浆果的残渣。也许还是等你伴侣开着车回来再测试你的觅食技巧比较好。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:20188:20232"
    },
    {
      "id": "77:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你抱着胳膊继续走，目不斜视地看着小路，强迫自己专注于当下。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:20232:20263"
    },
    {
      "id": "77:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "在你左边，你听到有流水的声音。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:20263:20280"
    },
    {
      "id": "77:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要调查声音的源头，转到 44。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:20280:20297"
    },
    {
      "id": "77:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要留在小路上，转到 49。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:20297:20312"
    }
  ]
}
